{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"cannot_tell\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"We recorded GI and STN local field potentials (LFPs) via externalized cables in 38 patients with PD (35 reporting FOG in daily life), both OFF‐ and ON‐dopamine (DOPA).\",\n    \"Here, we investigated the link between STN neuronal activity in the posterior and central STN regions and gait and postural abilities, including FOG, in 38 patients with PD. We recorded STN local field potentials (LFPs) using externalized cables together with gait kinetics and kinematics and identified the occurrence of FOG episodes.\",\n    \"We recruited 38 patients with PD (mean age [SD] = 57.6 [9.2] years, 27 M/11 F; Supplementary Table S1) scheduled for STN‐DBS at Pitié‐Salpêtrière and Rouen University Hospitals, between February 2013 and September 2021.\",\n    \"Patients with PD were included in 2 clinical trials: the GB‐MOV study (INSERM sponsor, n = 29) and the MAGIC study (CHU ROUEN sponsor, n = 9).\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"报告的说法涉及其references和evidence如何分别收录DOI预印本与PMID正式发表记录，以及是否建立版本对应关系。这些属于报告的文献处理行为，论文全文没有涉及DOI、预印本、版本对应关系，也没有提供报告的references或evidence清单，因此无法判断，不能认定为no。指控者的描述部分有依据：全文明确表明，该论文报告的是一项纳入38名帕金森病患者、研究步态启动（GI）与丘脑底核局部场电位（STN-LFP）关系的研究。但是，全文没有提及对应的预印本或其DOI，也没有明确说明预印本与正式发表版本之间的关系。因此，仅凭全文不能确认两个标识对应同一研究的两个版本，也不能独立证明应如何建立版本关联。另需注意，论文说明38名患者分别来自GB-MOV（29人）和MAGIC（9人）两个临床试验，但这是患者来源的说明，并不意味着本文是两项独立发表的研究。综合而言，指控者关于论文所报告的38人研究的描述有全文依据，但关于两个标识之间的版本对应关系缺少全文证据，故为partly。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a9d26685-4c43-4cd9-a660-27a3b6b805f4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T125158844133Z", "elapsed_seconds": 47.485, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T12:52:46.337869+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "re